{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17215040","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17215040","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1721504001:1":{"text":"ヘンドリック卿、古聖堂で一体何が起きたんだ？","source_cn":"亨德里克卿，圣古堂里到底发生了什么事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3211C2B7D9E71E86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721504002:1":{"text":"ヘンドリックは古聖堂で起きたことを、エイドリアンに包み隠さず報告した。","source_cn":"亨德里克将他在圣古堂中经历的一切，一五一十地向奥利安王...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74C946729F6E9C42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721504003:1":{"text":"アレイン女史の失踪を調査している最中、何らかの力で古聖堂の内部へ強制的に転送されたのです。","source_cn":"殿下，属下在调查阿莱茵女士失踪案时，被某种力量强行传送...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x899EF278ABCEF5BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721504004:2":{"text":"そこで、魔法で動く鎧や魔物の襲撃を受けました――あれは事故ではなく、あらかじめ仕組まれていたものだと思われます。","source_cn":"在那里，属下遭遇了被魔法驱动的活动盔甲和魔物的袭击——...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CA626D38E3E4AA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721504005:1":{"text":"動く鎧？古聖堂に魔物……？ヘンドリック卿、つまり君は、今回の件は人の手による襲撃だと言いたいんだな？","source_cn":"活动盔甲？圣古堂里的魔物？亨德里克卿，你是想说这是一场...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA05E3E60AF9AE9F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721504006:1":{"text":"はい。さらに不可解なのは、カリバーンがひとりでに台座から浮かび上がり、魔物を退けたことです。そのような前例は聞いたことがありません。この件には、まだ何か裏があるはずです。","source_cn":"正是。更令人生疑的是，随后石中剑竟自行出鞘“驱逐”了魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC223AFE7E53D73F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721504007:1":{"text":"ただ……その直後、再び強制的に送り返されてしまい、それ以上の手がかりは得られておりません。","source_cn":"只是……这件事情发生后属下就再次被强行传送了回来，所以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC1A6F2F2F9516B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721504008:1":{"text":"なるほど……","source_cn":"我明白了，亨德里克卿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BCBAEE84426CC50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721504009:1":{"text":"古聖堂が消えた時、その場にいたのは姫様と宮廷魔術師のカスティー殿だけです。あのお二人なら、より詳しい事情をご存じかもしれません。","source_cn":"不过，圣古堂消失时，公主殿下和魔法师科丝蒂是唯二在场的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF97494188750CDB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721504010:1":{"text":"だがペギーは……彼女も宮廷魔術師も、まだ戻ってきていない。","source_cn":"但佩吉她……和宫廷魔法师仍未归来。她们很可能还被困在那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AA5426522EBCA05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721504011:1":{"text":"二人はまだ消えた古聖堂の中にいるのかもしれない……","source_cn":"我认为，她们应该还被困在那个消失的圣古堂中。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC490110E16FC137","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721504012:2":{"text":"殿下、これは偶然ではありません！敵の手口も狙いも不明ですが、王室の安全はすでに脅かされています。どうかご用心ください。","source_cn":"殿下，这绝非偶然！对方手段隐秘、目标不明，已威胁到王室...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D0EEA8496BD0386","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1721504013:1":{"text":"もちろんだ。だが、今回の件でサバンナでは噂が後を絶たず、人々は不安を募らせている……","source_cn":"我自然不会放松警惕。但眼下赛凡纳流言四起、人心惶惶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD85E89CA88A8EDE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1721504014:1":{"text":"私は王太子としての責務を全うしなければならない。今日の上層街での公務には、予定どおり私自身が出席するよ。","source_cn":"我必须履行王储的职责，今日原定的上城区公务，我仍需亲自出席。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F6C870CA36FB6D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1721504015:1":{"text":"ですが、今最優先すべきは殿下の安全です。敵の正体も分からない今、危険を冒すべきではないと思います。","source_cn":"殿下，您的安全才是第一要务。幕后黑手的手段太过隐秘，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE94C0ACFB523DD28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1721504016:1":{"text":"分かっている。けれど、それが私の責務なんだ。","source_cn":"这是我的责任，亨德里克卿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x509F82E9C9D0D10D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1721504017:2":{"text":"……でしたら、護衛として私も同行させてください。","source_cn":"……既然如此，请允许属下全程随行护卫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEC8E4500C5A0DB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1721504018:1":{"text":"分かった。よろしく頼むよ、ヘンドリック卿。","source_cn":"好吧。那就劳烦你了，亨德里克卿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x733262766B0556CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1721504019:0":{"text":"グウィネス、なぜここに！","source_cn":"格温妮丝，你怎么在这里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DF2234E36E8E4C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奥利安":{"text":"エイドリアン","source":"奥利安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"ナレーション","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:亨德里克":{"text":"ヘンドリック","source":"亨德里克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":3}}